sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Sales as Sales Representative
    participant App as Sales Mobile App
    participant API as RetailersController
    participant Service as RetailerService
    participant Store as RetailerStore
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    %% ==========================================
    %% 1. ENTER RETAILER DECLARATION
    %% ==========================================

    Sales->>+App: Open Declare Retailer

    App-->>Sales: Display registration form
    deactivate App

    Note over Sales,App: General Information and Shelf-life Requirements

    Sales->>+App: Enter retailer information and assessment

    Note right of App: Store details, contact, GPS location,<br/>storefront photo, sales group,<br/>business potential and optional MLOR

    %% ==========================================
    %% 2. CREATE RETAILER DECLARATION
    %% ==========================================

    App->>+API: Declare(retailerData, mlorRules)

    API->>+Service: DeclareAsync(retailerData, mlorRules)

    Service->>+Store: Check territory access and duplicate retailer

    Store->>+DB: SELECT sales group and existing retailers

    DB-->>Store: Access and duplicate check results
    deactivate DB

    Store-->>Service: Validation data
    deactivate Store

    alt Valid declaration and no duplicate

        Service->>+Store: Save retailer, assessment and MLOR

        Store->>+DB: INSERT retailer, contact, location,<br/>sales assignment and MLOR records

        DB-->>Store: Saved retailer record
        deactivate DB

        Store-->>Service: Declaration created
        deactivate Store

        Service-->>API: Retailer declaration result

    else Invalid data, duplicate or unauthorized

        Service-->>API: Validation / Conflict / Forbidden error

    end

    deactivate Service

    API-->>App: Declaration response
    deactivate API

    App-->>Sales: Display declaration result
    deactivate App

    %% ==========================================
    %% 3. UPDATE DECLARATION IF NECESSARY
    %% ==========================================

    opt Sales updates declaration before review

        Sales->>+App: Edit retailer information or MLOR

        App->>+API: UpdateDeclaration(retailerId, updatedData)

        API->>+Service: UpdateDeclarationAsync(retailerId, updatedData)

        Service->>+Store: Validate and update declaration

        Store->>+DB: SELECT declaration / UPDATE retailer and MLOR

        DB-->>Store: Updated records or error
        deactivate DB

        Store-->>Service: Update result
        deactivate Store

        Service-->>API: Updated declaration or error
        deactivate Service

        API-->>App: Update response
        deactivate API

        App-->>Sales: Display updated declaration
        deactivate App

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% 4. SUBMIT FOR REVIEW
    %% ==========================================

    opt Declaration successfully created

        Sales->>+App: Submit declaration for review

        App->>+API: SubmitForReview(retailerId)

        API->>+Service: SubmitForReviewAsync(retailerId)

        Service->>+Store: Retrieve declaration for review validation

        Store->>+DB: SELECT retailer, contact,<br/>assessment and MLOR requirements

        DB-->>Store: Declaration details
        deactivate DB

        Store-->>Service: Declaration information
        deactivate Store

        alt Complete and eligible for review

            Service->>+Store: Update retailer status to Pending Review

            Store->>+DB: UPDATE retailer status and audit record

            DB-->>Store: Status updated
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Submission completed
            deactivate Store

            Service-->>API: Submitted successfully

        else Missing information or invalid status

            Service-->>API: Submission rejected

        end

        deactivate Service

        API-->>App: Submission response
        deactivate API

        App-->>Sales: Display Pending Review or error
        deactivate App

    end

    Note over Sales,DB: Administrator review and approval are handled in Figure 3.2.3